Prominent modification notice
-----------------------------

This derivative was substantially modified in 2026. Major changes include:

- replacing the shared upstream OAuth/token-exchange model with user-owned
  Google OAuth clients and direct token exchange with Google;
- moving OAuth secrets to Obsidian SecretStorage and keeping temporary
  authorization state device-local;
- adding a public static OAuth redirect bridge with no server-side token
  exchange or storage;
- configurable target calendars and explicit primary-calendar confirmation;
- explicit vault scanning scope and opt-in full-vault scanning;
- explicit/previewed destructive repair instead of automatic orphan cleanup;
- compatibility fixes for recurring tasks generated by Obsidian Tasks;
- informational calendar events, reminder/duration/end-time syntax,
  autocomplete, setup transfer, diagnostics, and improved mobile behavior;
- time-zone persistence and synchronization safety/concurrency improvements.

